                  "description": "`filter` narrows which traces are returned for this thread, using a LangSmith filter expression evaluated against each root trace run.\nFor example: eq(status, \"success\") or has(tags, \"production\").\nSee https://docs.langchain.com/langsmith/trace-query-syntax#filter-query-language for syntax."
